<title>USA: Amex begins trading Cornell Corrections.</title>
<headline>Amex begins trading Cornell Corrections.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange said Thursday it began trading the common stock of Cornell Corrections Inc, a developer and operator of federal and state prisons.</p>
<p>The company's stock opened at 12-3/4 on 100 shares, and was followed by 601,800 shares at the same price.</p>
<p>The intial public offering consisted of four million shares with an over-allotment option of 600,000 shares. Once the offering is complete, the company will have 6,765,398 shares outstanding.</p>
